{
  "id": "71",
  "title": "珞琭子消息赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“珞琭子消息赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "元一气兮先天，稟清浊兮自然；著三才以为象，播四时以为年。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-4a6547661d891bdc6a65-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "以干为禄，以向背定贫富；以支为命，详顺逆以循环。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-c5b64f703b3a01ccdf6c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "运行则一辰十载。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-271a443d8a708416a171-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "折除乃三日为年；折除者乃一年二十四气，七十二候。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-dc779d7bf07dea1f6783-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命有节气浅深，用之而为妙。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d8b6073e057dab662d6b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "其为气也，将来者进，成功者退；如蛇在灰，如鱔在尘。气者，四时向背之气也；其为有也，是从无而立有；其为无也，天垂象以为文；此五行临于绝地而建贵也。五行绝处有禄马；其为常也，立仁立义；其为事也，或见或闻。崇为实也，奇为贵也，将星扶德，天乙加临，本主休囚，行藏汩没。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-ae281ff6a8c8dbe350a3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "至若，勾陈得位，不亏小信以成仁；真武当权，是知大才而分瑞。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-3a77690583df828610c7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "不仁不义，庚辛与甲乙交争。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-a29a9c43464425f51a36-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或是或非，壬癸与丙丁相畏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-ff9ab7dcea91b0626ce6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "故，有先贤谦己，处俗求仙；崇释则离宫修定，归道乃水府求玄。见不见之形，无时不有；抽不抽之绪，万古联绵。是以何公惧其七杀；宣父畏以元辰；峨眉阐以三生，无全士庶；鬼谷布其九命，约以星观。今集诸家之要，略其偏见之能，是以未解曲通，玅须神悟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-5c4ebeaaba268a61661e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "臣出自兰野，幼慕真风；入肆无悬壶之玅，游街无化杖之神；息一气以凝神，消五行而通道。乾坤立其牝牡，金木定其刚柔；昼夜分为君臣，时节分为父子，不可一途而取，不可一理而推。时有冬逢炎热，夏草遭霜；类有阴鼠栖水，神龟宿火；是以阴阳罕测，志物难穷。大抵三冬暑少，九夏阳多，祸福有若禎祥，术士希其八九。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-412cd4fbb7c0ef3a06a3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或若生居休败，早岁空亡；若遇健旺之乡，连年偃蹇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d414b2245e64ce18f843-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若乃，初凶后吉，相源浊而流清；始吉终凶，状根甘而裔苦。观乎萌兆，察以其元；根是苗先，实从花后；胎生元命，三兽定其门宗；律吕宫商，五虎论其成败。无合有合，后学难知；得一分三，前贤不载。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-42987ffa08ff01c71220-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年虽逢于冠带，尚有餘灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-19aa71ede5c9226db179-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "运将至于衰乡，犹披少福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-41a1d677b73b27ac7067-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大段，天元羸弱，宫吉不及以为营；日下兴隆，月凶不能成其咎。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-57b75ff5ff98b5dece75-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若遇，尊凶卑吉，救疗无功；尊吉卑凶，逢灾自愈。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-0801880f9cbc790981e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄有三会，灾有五期。凶多吉少，类大过之初爻；福浅祸深，喻同人之九五。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-8bf83c3b4f14be0b2716-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "闻喜不喜，是六甲之盈亏；当忧不忧，赖五行之救助。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-78869f32294df7ca5af9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "八孤临于五墓，戌未东行；六虚下于空亡，自乾南首。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-b9d8e8a5dfb886aa01e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天元一气，定侯伯之尊荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-29b8c07431168a0125a2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "支作人元，运商徒而得失。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-3a6707d25bf431608a87-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若乃，身旺鬼绝，虽破命而长生；鬼旺身衰，逢建禄而寿夭。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-c91d651ccf6160cd48d9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "背禄逐马，守穷途而悽惶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-180eb0b8407ddac8af89-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄马同乡，不三台而八座。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-f15facadde4dda78464a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官崇位显，定知夹禄之乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-27b1b1ebfd5bc3169228-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "小盈大亏，恐是劫财之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d64a481b9552ffe4b1ff-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生月带禄，入仕居赫奕之尊。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d88418bb81194c79721c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "重犯奇仪，蕴藉抱出群之器。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-92927023156e2a6bfd4b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴男阳女，时观出入之年；阴女阳男，更看元辰之岁，与地之相逢。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-a1b7664d7e04c2566f69-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "宜退身而避位，凶会吉会，返吟伏吟，阴错阳差，天冲地击；或逢四杀五鬼，六害七伤，天罗地网，三元九宫。福臻成庆，祸并危凝；扶兮速速，抑乃迟迟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-e4348a0ce8b8c94ff310-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "历贵地而待时。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-c92e4ca5cbc109e2aa66-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "遇比肩而争竞。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-6f11440e13cda9de765f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "至若人疲马劣，犹托财旺之乡；或乃财旺禄衰，健马何避。掩冲岁临，尚不为灾，年登故宜获福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-a9e80f2534474ababae8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大吉主逢小吉，及寿长年。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-b82da72940ab5240e984-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天罡运至天魁，继生续寿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-b9bb65ba04fbbb039289-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "从魁抵苍龙之宿，财自天来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-839840777ee40aeaa794-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天冲临昴胃之乡，人元有害。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-8a83aa1f1b800ca9c70d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金禄穷于正首，庚重辛轻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-5c829130dff2526d3e50-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木人困于金乡，寅深卯浅。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d3e5e3ad3d61a8028ed8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "玅在识其通变，拙说犹神；巫瞽昧于调絃，难希律吕。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-c760dbdeff29297e6f1c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辛临于甲乙，君子可以求官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-b5669600eaaa4f55a160-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "北人运至南方，贸易获其厚利。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-60cb566a9a69714b1362-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "开朝懽而旋至，为盛火之炎阳。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-42b885dd10467340036f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "剋祸福之遥，则多因于水土。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-fbde7c8cec6fe9723484-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金木未能成器，听衰乐以难明；似木盛而花繁，状密云而不雨。乘轩衣冕，金火何多；位穷班卑，阴阳不定。所以，龙吟虎啸，风雨助其休祥；火势将兴，故先烟而后焰。每见凶中有吉，吉乃先凶；吉中有凶，凶为吉兆；祸旬向末，言福可以近推。纔入衰乡，论灾宜其逆课。男迎女送，否泰交居；阴阳二气，逆顺折除。占其金木之内，显于方所分野；标其南北之间，恐不利于往来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-07c458ee8916227779d3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "一旬之内，于年中而问月；一岁之中，求月中而问日。向三避五，指方面以穷通；审吉查凶，述岁中之否泰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-ad7c3dafe012d944b8f9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙寅丁卯，秋天宜以保持。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-1e1ec68c5046346e8ab4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己巳戊辰，度乾（亥）宫而脱厄。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-badd6ee0a588121ef104-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "值病忧病，迟生得生；旺相崢嶸，休囚绝灭。论其眷属，忧其死绝，墓在鬼中；危疑者甚，足下临丧，面前可见。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-a374301b72717fc9ce2e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凭阴察其阳福，岁君莫犯于孤辰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-f4389d5be055894b52b5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "恃阳鑑以阴灾，天元忌逢于寡宿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-4a2f9971bd59fbd2856a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "先论二气，次课延生；父病推其子禄，妻灾课以夫年。三宫元吉，祸迟可以延推；始末皆凶，灾忽来如迅速。宅墓受杀，落梁尘以呻吟；丧吊临人，变宫商为薤露。干推两重，防灾于元首之间；支折三轻，慎祸于股肱之内。下元一气，同居去住之期；仁而不仁，虑伤伐于戊己。至于寝食侍卫，物有鬼物，人有鬼人；逢之为灾，去之为福。就在裸形夹杀，魄往酆都，所犯有伤，魂归岱岭。或乃行来出入，抵犯凶方，嫁娶修营，路登黄道；灾福在岁年之位内，发觉申日时之击扬。五神相剋，三生定命。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-601665c4c37b8af7507b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "每见，贵人食禄，无非禄马之乡；源浊伏吟，惆悵歇宫之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-9df8762d7f7a9ad167e8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "狂横起于勾绞。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-183c18657d83d19aeed7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "祸败发于元亡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-975fa7e3cdec018381c2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "宅墓同处，恐少乐而忧多。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-df3ad4b0fbc3a9f1b515-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "万里回还，乃是三归之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-124454839a53d294530f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四杀之父，多生五鬼之男。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-b06f5810a8412e8a29fa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六害之徒，命有七伤之事。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-f30fe7816c5a79d76779-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "眷属情同水火，相逢于沐浴之间。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d284a9b3c4ebe7776cfc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "骨肉中道分离，孤宿犹嫌于隔角。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-36eccebb4b7fcce80ea2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "须要制其神煞，轻重较量；身剋杀而尚轻，杀剋身而尤重。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d7c28984c5455095a3ae-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "至于循环八卦，因河洛以为文，略之为定一端，究之翻成万绪。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-9597a37b543fffd646dc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若值，扳鞍践禄，逢之则佩印乘轩；马劣财微，遇之则流而不返。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-3a1dee1011b9b7a15a58-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "善恶相伴，摇动迁移，夹杀持丘，亲姻哭送；兼须察其操执，观其秉持。原薄论其骨状，成器藉于心源。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-98fc687855b410c05c93-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木气盛而仁昌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-20ff8c4aba30aacefd7a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辛亏而义寡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-02fafd9853942804e3cf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "吉曜而有喜，疑其灾器。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-b775a9763083f137e7b7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "福星临而祸发，以表凶人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-e7c1ebe2aa9602028d78-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "处定求动，剋未进而难迁；居安虑危，可以凶中而卜吉。贵而忘贱，灾自奢生；迷而不返，祸从惑起。殊当易从变处为萌，福善祸淫，吉凶异兆。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-a2a339cb11cd10e1e401-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "至于公明、季玉，尚无变识之文；景纯、仲舒，不载比形之妙。详其往圣，盖以前贤；或指事以陈谋，或约文而切理。多或少利，二义难精。今者参详得失，补缀道踪，规为心鉴，永掛清莹，引列终绪，十希得九。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "71-d9d308ad2c64647d35b0-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
